# Deploy-only, filtered copy of nets_synergy.db (~13MB - just the
# GROUP_QUANTITY=2/2025-26 lineups slice the live app actually queries,
# see src/pipeline/build_deploy_db.py) - small enough to commit directly,
# unlike the full 211MB working db above.
!data/nets_synergy_deploy.db

# data/stints/ is ~296MB total (raw_cache/, games/, other seasons) - almost
# all of it only used by the offline src/pipeline/ scripts (build_stints.py,
# fit_rapm.py), never read by the live app. But step2b_player_diagnostics.py's
# individual_role_sensitivity_profile() (Section D3 "Usage Elasticity", live
# on both the Player Breakdown page and the PDF report) DOES read two small
# 2025-26 files directly - confirmed the exact FileNotFoundError from the
# deployed app traces to this, not assumed. `data/stints/*` (not
# `data/stints/`) is required here: a directory-level exclusion pattern
# blocks git from ever looking inside it, so per-file negation below
# wouldn't take effect - this glob-on-contents form still lets it.
data/stints/*
!data/stints/stints_2025_26_v2.parquet
!data/stints/stints_2025_26.parquet
!data/stints/events_2025_26.parquet
AI_USAGE.md
CLAUDE.md
DIAGNOSTICS_README.md